The user should be able to see how the selected project looks on different device sizes.

Provide controls for:

Desktop
Laptop
iPad / Tablet
Mobile

Use clear simple icons and/or labels.

Preferred order:

Desktop | Laptop | iPad | Mobile

The active device should be visually obvious.

Keep the control monochrome and elegant.

No bright random colors.

==================================================
