==================================================

When the user selects a device:

The project itself should remain the SAME project.

Only the preview viewport changes.

Do NOT navigate to a different page.

Do NOT load a separate fake screenshot.

The actual interactive project should render inside the selected viewport width.

Suggested logical widths:

Desktop:
1280–1440px

Laptop:
1100–1280px

iPad:
768–1024px

Mobile:
375–430px

The preview should scale visually to fit inside the available viewer area while preserving the logical responsive width.

The project must remain fully interactive.

The user should still be able to:

- scroll
- click buttons
- open menus
- use forms
- browse galleries
- add items to cart
- use demo AI
- use filters
- use reservation controls

depending on the project.

